  "CharacterDescription": "Eon Hunter is the Lord of Longbow Hall in the Vale and head of House Hunter - a Vale house known for its archers. He is an old man now past seventy with three quarrelsome sons: Gilwood, Eustace, and Harlan. His greatest challenge in his final years is managing the succession without the three sons destroying the house in the process. He is a figure of the old Vale - the traditions, the mountain lords, the way of doing things that predates the current political chaos. He has no patience for chaos and considerable contempt for lords who cannot manage their own houses.",
